isschen nervös, weil ich so eine Nervosität selten habe. Support: Kein Problem, wir lösen das schon. Kunde: Trotzdem ärgere ich mich eben ein bisschen darüber. Support: Das ist halt verständlich, aber wir kümmern uns sofort darum.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","title":"Chat: Eine Reklamation im Kundenservice","control":"button \"Listen to passage\"","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":1,"text":"Timo, die Nationalmannschaft hat schon wieder verloren.","speaker":"Nike","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_056_L001","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":2,"text":"Ich weiß, das ist eben ärgerlich, aber so ist Fußball halt manchmal.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_056_L002","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":3,"text":"Und mein Vorstellungsgespräch heute lief auch nicht so gut.","speaker":"Nike","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_056_L003","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"section":"listening","type":"listening-sentence","idx":4,"text":"Ach, das war halt einfach kein guter Tag — morgen sieht das schon wieder anders aus.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_056_L004","control":"button.audio-play-btn (sequence)","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":1,"text":"Timo, die Nationalmannschaft hat schon wieder verloren.","speaker":"Nike","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_056_L001","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":2,"text":"Ich weiß, das ist eben ärgerlich, aber so ist Fußball halt manchmal.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_056_L002","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":3,"text":"Und mein Vorstellungsgespräch heute lief auch nicht so gut.","speaker":"Nike","voiceRole":"female","authoredLineId":"B2_056_L003","reachable":false},{"chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2","section":"listening","type":"listening-authored-line","idx":4,"text":"Ach, das war halt einfach kein guter Tag — morgen sieht das schon wieder anders aus.","speaker":"Timo","voiceRole":"male","authoredLineId":"B2_056_L004","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":1,"text":"Das ist eben ärgerlich, aber so ist Fußball halt manchmal.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":1,"text":"Die Nationalmannschaft hat wieder verloren. Reagiere gelassen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":2,"text":"Es lief halt nicht gut, ich war eben zu nervös.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":2,"text":"Dein Freund fragt nach deinem Vorstellungsgespräch.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":3,"text":"Ich habe halt keine Zeit, ich lerne abends.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":3,"text":"Eine Kollegin fragt, warum du nie mitkommst.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":4,"text":"Dann machen wir es eben morgen.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":4,"text":"Der Termin platzt. Zieh einen ruhigen Schluss.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false},{"section":"speaking","type":"speaking-model","idx":5,"text":"Das dauert eben. — Und wir müssen halt noch einmal nachhaken.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","control":"button \"Hear model\"","chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2"},{"chapter":"b2-56-modalpartikeln-eben-halt","level":"B2","section":"speaking","type":"speaking-task-prompt","idx":5,"text":"Rollenspiel: Ihr sprecht über eine Reklamation, die nichts brachte.","voiceRole":"narrator-female","reachable":false}],"controls":{"story-play-line":6,"story-play-all":1,"vword-voice-F":22,"vword-voice-M":22,"vword-listen":22,"listen-to-passage":1,"audio-play-btn":1,"hear-model":5},"surfaces":[{"n":1,"w":"Korrekturen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":15,"w":"die","from":"vocab-article","type":"Article"},{"n":5,"w":"— (Sg.)","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Musterklausuren","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Nationalmannschaften","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Produktbeschreibungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Profimannschaften","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Querschnittslähmungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Ratgebersendungen","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w":"Redemittel","from":"vocab-plural","type":"Noun · plural"},{"n":1,"w